{"version":"2026.10.11-r25","id":"Q135006615","formula":"N₆","hill":"N6","elements":["N"],"composition":{"N":6.0},"names":{"en":"Hexanitrogen","ru":"Гексаазот"},"descriptions":{"en":"Hexanitrogen (diazide, hexaaza-1,2,4,5-tetraene) is an allotrope of nitrogen with the formula N6. The six nitrogen atoms are all covalently bonded in a single molecule: two azide units linked to each other. Its stability and structure were theorized in 2016 and its synthesis was reported in 2025.","ru":"Гексаазо́т (диази́д) — аллотропная форма азота, состоящая из линейных шестиатомных молекул N6. Кроме природного N2, это первый (и на 2025 год единственный) относительно стабильный аллотроп азота, хотя попытки синтеза различных иных, с большим двух количеством атомов азота, ведутся давно."},"fame":7,"pubchemCid":23527683,"mass":84.04,"charge":0,"smiles":"[N-]=[N+]=NN=[N+]=[N-]","inchikey":"UCDGJNRDJKMFBS-UHFFFAOYSA-N","iupac":null,"classes":[{"qid":"Q113145171","names":{"en":"type of chemical entity","ru":"тип химического объекта","uk":"тип хімічної сутності"}}],"structureInfo":{"kind":"molecule","source":"pubchem","ref":"23527683","atoms":6,"license":"PubChem (NIH), public data"},"structure":{"kind":"molecule","atoms":[{"x":-0.423,"y":0.551,"z":0.0,"el":"N"},{"x":0.423,"y":-0.551,"z":0.0,"el":"N"},{"x":-1.607,"y":0.17,"z":0.0,"el":"N"},{"x":1.607,"y":-0.17,"z":0.0,"el":"N"},{"x":-2.69,"y":-0.188,"z":0.0,"el":"N"},{"x":2.69,"y":0.188,"z":0.0,"el":"N"}],"bonds":[[0,1,1],[0,2,2],[1,3,2],[2,4,2],[3,5,2]]},"sources":[{"role":"identity","name":"Wikidata","url":"https://www.wikidata.org/wiki/Q135006615","license":"CC0 1.0"},{"role":"description","name":"Wikipedia (en)","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Hexanitrogen","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0"},{"role":"description","name":"Wikipedia (ru)","url":"https://ru.wikipedia.org/wiki/%D0%93%D0%B5%D0%BA%D1%81%D0%B0%D0%B0%D0%B7%D0%BE%D1%82","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0"},{"role":"properties","name":"PubChem","url":"https://pubchem.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/compound/23